0.4.0

Release: Initial Production Release
Date: 2026-05-09
Description:
  First stable release of the IoT Gateway application for Raspberry Pi 3.
  Includes LED blink control, HTTPS firmware download server, Wi-Fi manager,
  OTP-based multi-factor authentication, blockchain activity logger using
  Keccak-256, user authentication, and TLS certificate management.
  Firmware image is signed via Google Cloud KMS HSM (RSA-PSS 2048-bit)
  and registered on the Polygon Amoy blockchain for tamper-proof verification.
